                <mxCell id="gatekeeper-box" value="OPA Gatekeeper (Admission Webhook)&#xa;K8sRequiredLabels → namespaces must have admission=true&#xa;VulnerabilityScan → block high/critical CVE images&#xa;CodeCoverageSimple → require commit-sha annotation ≥80%&#xa;FalcoRootPrevention → block UID 0 / privileged containers&#xa;RequireIDPOriginNamespaces → namespaces must have managed-by=teams-operator&#xa;RequireIDPOriginWorkloads → Deployments/Rollouts must have managed-by=teams-operator&#xa;RequireArgoRollouts → enforce Rollout CRD in team-* &amp; production ns" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#ffe6cc;strokeColor=#d79b00;fontSize=10;" parent="gatekeeper-ns" vertex="1">
                    <mxGeometry x="10" y="30" width="540" height="85" as="geometry"/>
